---
// BentoGrid.astro - Modern interactive Bento Grid for Corilla features
---

<section id="features">
  <div class="section-content">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR TECHNICAL TEAMS</span>
      <h2>Everything you need to write, manage, and scale docs</h2>
      <p>Corilla combines the structure of enterprise technical communication with the speed and joy of modern markdown.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento-grid">
      <!-- Bento Card 1 (Large - In-Templates) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-hero">
        <div class="bento-content">
          <div class="card-tag">CORE WORKFLOW</div>
          <h3>Pre-Built In-Templates</h3>
          <p>Don't stare at a blank page. Corilla gives you standardized topic templates based on information architecture best practices—ready to edit in seconds.</p>
          
          <div class="templates-preview">
            <div class="template-pill active">
              <span class="tpl-icon">📋</span>
              <div class="tpl-text">
                <strong>Task Template</strong>
                <small>Goal, Prerequisites, Steps</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="template-pill">
              <span class="tpl-icon">💡</span>
              <div class="tpl-text">
                <strong>Concept Template</strong>
                <small>Overview, Architecture, Context</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="template-pill">
              <span class="tpl-icon">⚡</span>
              <div class="tpl-text">
                <strong>API Reference</strong>
                <small>Endpoint, Headers, Responses</small>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="template-pill">
              <span class="tpl-icon">🛠️</span>
              <div class="tpl-text">
                <strong>Troubleshooting</strong>
                <small>Issue, Cause, Resolution</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 2 (Medium - Single Sourcing) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-single-source">
        <div class="bento-content">
          <div class="card-tag">SCALE & EFFICIENCY</div>
          <h3>Single-Source Reuse</h3>
          <p>Write an authentication guide, compliance clause, or product spec once. Reuse it across all your product manuals and portals with zero duplicate content.</p>
          <div class="reuse-diagram">
            <div class="source-topic">
              <span class="tag">TOPIC</span>
              <code>auth-setup.md</code>
            </div>
            <div class="connectors">
              <span class="line"></span>
              <span class="line"></span>
              <span class="line"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="destinations">
              <span class="dest">Web Docs</span>
              <span class="dest">API Hub</span>
              <span class="dest">Internal Runbook</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 3 (Medium - Version Control) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-versioning">
        <div class="bento-content">
          <div class="card-tag">RELIABILITY</div>
          <h3>Git-Backed Version Control</h3>
          <p>Full versioning, tagging, and draft approvals without command-line friction. Never overwrite a teammate's edits or ship unapproved copy.</p>
          <div class="diff-preview">
            <div class="diff-line del">- version: "2.1.0-beta"</div>
            <div class="diff-line add">+ version: "2.1.0" // Production release</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 4 (Small - Markdown Native) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-small">
        <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Blazing-Fast Markdown</h3>
        <p>No clunky WYSIWYG lag. Clean Markdown authoring with live preview, syntax highlighting, and table support.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 5 (Small - Collaboration) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-small">
        <div class="card-icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Team Draft Reviews</h3>
        <p>Share review drafts with developers, PMs, and stakeholders. In-line comments make sign-off effortless.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Card 6 (Small - Multi-Channel Hosting) -->
      <div class="bento-card bento-small">
        <div class="card-icon">🌐</div>
        <h3>Multi-Channel Export</h3>
        <p>Publish to your custom domain, generate PDF documentation, or export to external pipelines with a single click.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Social Proof Pull Quote -->
    <div class="call-to-action-quote">
      <div class="quote-stars">★★★★★</div>
      <h3>"Corilla is like GitHub for content teams. Our writers love it, and our customers actually read it."</h3>
      <p class="quote-author">— Trusted by technical writing teams across 80+ countries</p>
      <div class="quote-cta">
        <a class="button" href="https://app.corilla.com/register">
          Start Writing with Templates <span class="arrow">⟶</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #features {
    padding: 7em 1.5em;
    background: #F8FAFB;
  }

  .section-content {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0 auto 4.5em;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #8B7500;
    margin-bottom: 0.75em;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    margin-bottom: 0.4em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: #5F6F78;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Bento Grid Layout */
  .bento-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5em;
    margin-bottom: 5em;
  }

  .bento-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E5E9EC;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2.5em;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .bento-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px -8px rgba(11, 44, 62, 0.08);
    border-color: #CBD5DC;
  }

  .card-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    background: #F7D33A;
    padding: 0.2em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25em;
  }

  .bento-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    margin-bottom: 0.5em;
  }

  .bento-card p {
    color: #5F6F78;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Bento Hero Card (Spans 2 columns) */
  .bento-hero {
    grid-column: span 2;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 60%, #FFFDF2 100%);
    border: 2px solid #F7D33A;
  }

  .templates-preview {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.75em;
    margin-top: 1.75em;
  }

  .template-pill {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E5E9EC;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75em 1em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75em;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(11, 44, 62, 0.03);
  }

  .template-pill.active {
    border-color: #0B2C3E;
    background: #0B2C3E;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .template-pill.active strong {
    color: #F7D33A;
  }

  .template-pill.active small {
    color: #D4D8DD;
  }

  .tpl-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tpl-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: #0B2C3E;
  }

  .tpl-text small {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #7F919A;
  }

  /* Bento Single Source Card */
  .bento-single-source {
    grid-column: span 1;
  }

  .reuse-diagram {
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    background: #F6F7F8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .source-topic {
    background: #0B2C3E;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 0.5em;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
  }

  .source-topic .tag {
    background: #F7D33A;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    font-size: 0.625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .source-topic code {
    color: #F7D33A;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .connectors {
    height: 18px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .connectors .line {
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    background: #D4D8DD;
  }

  .destinations {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.3em;
  }

  .dest {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #D4D8DD;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.3em 0.5em;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* Bento Versioning Card */
  .bento-versioning {
    grid-column: span 1;
  }

  .diff-preview {
    margin-top: 1.5em;
    background: #0B2C3E;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.75em 1em;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .diff-line.del {
    color: #FF93FB;
  }

  .diff-line.add {
    color: #72ECA2;
  }

  /* Bento Small Cards */
  .bento-small {
    grid-column: span 1;
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75em;
  }

  /* Pull Quote CTA */
  .call-to-action-quote {
    background: #0B2C3E;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3.5em 2.5em;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -10px rgba(11, 44, 62, 0.2);
  }

  .quote-stars {
    color: #F7D33A;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 1em;
  }

  .call-to-action-quote h3 {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 0.75em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .quote-author {
    color: #9AABB4;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 2em;
  }

  .quote-cta .button {
    font-family: 'Sailec-Medium', 'HelveticaNeue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    background: #F7D33A;
    color: #0B2C3E;
    padding: 0.75em 1.5em;
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: inline-block;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .quote-cta .button:hover {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .quote-cta .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .quote-cta .button:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 960px) {
    .bento-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .bento-hero,
    .bento-single-source,
    .bento-versioning,
    .bento-small {
      grid-column: span 1;
    }
    .templates-preview {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .call-to-action-quote h3 {
      font-size: 1.375rem;
    }
  }
</style>
